OL,3,GNEWSAWales plans to ban steel pylons as
OL,4,Agovernment launches consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company behind the plans, Green Gen
OL,7,FCymru, has been asked to comment but
OL,8,Fhas previously said that undergrounding
OL,9,Fcables would be significantly more
OL,10,Fexpensive than running them overhead.
